# Ignore everything by default...
*
# ...but keep folders, so git can look inside them
!*/
# ...and keep any file with an extension (.cpp .h .txt and so on)
!*.*
# ...and keep Makefiles, since they have no extension
!Makefile
# Now ignore the build junk that slipped back in above
*.o
*.exe
*.out
# Junk files from Windows, WSL and Mac
*:Zone.Identifier
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
# Editor settings
.vscode/